</nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MAINTECH CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEKIYA KUNIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MAINTECH CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEKIYA, KUNIO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEKIYA KUNIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEKIYA, KUNIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A dryer pollution prevention method in a paper machine capable of maintaining a drying efficiency and guaranteeing present pollution effects at all times for an extended time; specifically, a method of preventing pollution on the surface of a cylindrical dryer used in a paper machine, wherein a surface forming agent (P) in a constant amount is continuously supplied directly onto the surface of a rotating cylindrical dryer (D1) with web (W) supplied by the operation of the paper machine.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de prévention de la pollution d'un sécheur cylindrique dans une machine à papier, le procédé permettant de maintenir une efficacité de séchage et de garantir le sécheur contre des effets de pollution prédéfinis à tout moment pendant une longue période. Plus spécifiquement, l'invention concerne un procédé de prévention de la pollution à la surface d'un sécheur cylindrique dans une machine 